      "content": "it's just hard to hear about \"hope\" when the version of me that was capable of feeling hope is dead. that person doesn't exist anymore. even if i find a new job or some new thing to do, i'm still just a shell. the person everyone respected and knew... that person's gone. how can you talk about hope when the foundation of who i am has completely disintegrated?",
